---
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'
---

<section  class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[#262424] relative z-10">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight uppercase">
       What Makes the <br><span class="text-lime-400">Best Pickleball Machine?</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Top Features</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
          When shopping for the best pickleball ball machine, it's important to focus on the features that directly impact training. The most effective machines offer customization options like adjustable speed, spin control, and programmable shot patterns. These features allow players to simulate real match scenarios and develop smarter skills—not just muscle memory. 
          </p>
          <p>
          Whether you're a beginner or advanced player, control over drills is essential to getting the most out of a pickleball machine.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Portability vs. Power</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
           Choosing between a portable pickleball machine and a more powerful, stationary model is a common dilemma. While some lightweight units are easy to move, they often sacrifice shot variety or speed. The best models strike a balance—delivering high performance in a compact form. 
          </p>
          <p>
            Look for machines with long-lasting battery life and pro-level output to ensure uninterrupted training sessions, even when you're on the go.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Why Tennibot</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            When comparing cost and quality, Tennibot stands out as the smart investment. Their pickleball shooter systems combine AI-driven precision, mobile app integration, and adaptive learning features—offering far more than basic machines. 
          </p>
          <p>
         Tennibot’s commitment to innovation, ease of use, and strong customer support makes it the best pickleball machine for players who are serious about long-term improvement.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>